DESCRIPTION:CS Futures in the Age of AI seminar series\, hosted by the CS A
 I Council.\nSpeaker: Steve Wright\n\nAbstract: The past year has seen AI i
 mpact mathematical disciplines in profound\, escalating\, and revolutionar
 y ways\, giving rise to a new era of “proof abundance.” Optimization h
 as featured prominently in this process\, with new theoretical results eme
 rging at a rapid pace. Other aspects of optimization research and practice
 \, including software and applications\, have also been impacted. In fact\
 , AI has affected every aspect of our professional lives. This talk gives 
 a high-level overview of these developments\, with some examples drawn fro
 m my own limited experience\, and some thoughts on how we\, as a community
 \, might deal with the challenges and opportunities posed by AI models.\n\
